/// BVA board-summary guest read role (Sprint 15 · T6). Restricts the BVA
/// hospital dimension to the synthetic "Aggregated" rollup so a guest identity
/// can only ever see the blended, non-attributable board summary — never a
/// specific hospital's cost/value rows (design spec §8, mirrors the operational
/// GuestAggregated role). Assignable to HCC.GuestReadOnly in SIT and PROD.
role BvaBoardReadOnly
	modelPermission: read

	tablePermission bva_dim_hospital = [hospital_key] = "Aggregated"
